---
description: Safe implementation workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

- Before coding, inspect the relevant files and understand the existing implementation.
- For non-trivial tasks, identify the simplest implementation approach first.
- Make changes incrementally.
- Reuse existing code whenever possible.
- After implementation, run the most relevant validation.
- If validation fails, investigate and fix the cause.
- Do not consider the task complete until the relevant checks pass.
- Do not refactor unrelated code.
